Subject: [PATCH 25/59] tools decode-link: share links to outbounds

sing-box tools decode-link: the share links of VLESS, Trojan, Shadowsocks, SOCKS, Hysteria 2, TUIC,
VMess, HTTP, Hysteria, AnyTLS and NaiveProxy (forms found in the wild, Marzban and Remnawave) to an
outbound that is built to validate it, refused by a table of reasons, one link with an exit status
scripts can tell apart.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  a21a1de7c tools: add decode-link, share links to outbounds
  af5086aff tools decode-link: forms of links found in the wild
  da0e0898c tools decode-link: fixes from the review
  792343f11 tools decode-link: do not wrap a nil error
  bbb0e4ed4 tools decode-link: one link, and an exit status scripts can tell apart
  314ee80fd decode-link: build the outbound to validate it, refuse by a table of reasons
  d8b25182e decode-link: Shadowsocks, SOCKS, Hysteria 2, TUIC, VMess, HTTP, Hysteria, AnyTLS and NaiveProxy links
  dd1ab945b decode-link: options of sing-box by their paths, and what a link may not set
  6d198ad08 decode-link: what the links of Marzban and Remnawave showed
  b9e57c97b decode-link: what the fuzzer and the comparison with podkop's shell decoder showed
  850036226 decode-link: what the stand against real servers and two reviews showed
  c6d945af4 decode-link: pass the encryption of a VLESS link instead of refusing it
  fe08da04d sharelink: the scrubbing of messages is exported
  82a671ab8 cmd/sing-box: the command line in an importable package, cli
  66000c1d2 decode-link: the help names the links of every protocol it reads
  37176b416 sharelink: JSON in extra may hold both a space and an address
  a688f549b cmd/sing-box: the command line where upstream has it

